# Mixed Emotions: a two-player arena with twofold (180 degree) symmetry. The top
# half is written; SYMMETRY ROT2 repeats it rotated to form the bottom half.

NAME Mixed Emotions
SYMMETRY ROT2
WALLS K M
START 61 8 S

# Two bunkers flanking player 0's start.
MOVE 9 5
DRAW 12 5
DRAW 12 8
MOVE 22 5
DRAW 19 5
DRAW 19 8

# A central divider with a gap in the middle.
MOVE 4 15
DRAW 12 15
